WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.980
Fort Bend County approved up to 35 years of tax breaks for Tesla's proposed $10 billion solar factory. This is Tesla Shorts Time, episode 643, Austin's Geofence, robotaxi miles, and the iOS app follow, then counterpoint. Fort Bend County commissioners approved four agreements according to electric. Those agreements cover a chapter 312 abatement, a chapter 381 grant, a foreign trade zone payment in lieu of taxes, or pilot, and a true uppile

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:35.820
Equipment and inventory are exempt from county property taxes for the first 10 years, starting

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:42.720
as late as 2031. The county then refunds 90% of taxes for the following 20 years. Tesla

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:47.100
has not committed to the Richmond site and is still evaluating an out-of-state alternative.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:55.720
The agreement split a $10.1 billion investment into $1.520 million of real property and $8.6

00:00:55.720 --> 00:01:00.240
billion dollars of personal property. Land and buildings remain fully taxable.

00:01:01.243 --> 00:01:07.643
Tesla expanded its Robotaxi service area in Austin by 8 square miles to 272 square miles total.

00:01:08.303 --> 00:01:14.663
Tesla Roddy reports. The service currently operates in 6 US cities using Model Y and CyberCab vehicles.

00:01:15.363 --> 00:01:20.303
Austin remains the only city where CyberCabs without steering wheels or pedals are an active ride

00:01:20.303 --> 00:01:29.174
Hailing Use. Autonomous miles on the Robotaxi fleet reached 3,112,541 through October 18,

00:01:29.594 --> 00:01:36.414
Evan X reports. Those miles ran across Austin, Dallas, Houston, Miami, Orlando, and Tampa.

00:01:36.834 --> 00:01:43.094
The report recorded zero injuries, zero airbag deployments, and zero pedestrian or cyclist incidents.

00:01:43.654 --> 00:01:50.354
Austin accounted for more than 2.1 million of those miles. That Austin total includes 862,000

00:01:50.354 --> 00:01:56.794
miles at night and 113,000 in rain. Tesla also announced four new cities for the service,

00:01:57.354 --> 00:02:05.322
Las Vegas, Phoenix, Jacksonville, and San Antonio. The Tesla iOS app version 4.62.3 adds

00:02:05.322 --> 00:02:11.602
X money payment integration with wallet display and redirect handling, TSL aiming posted.

00:02:12.102 --> 00:02:17.982
It expands the full-self driving or FSD purchase flow from the statistics screen to subscription

00:02:17.982 --> 00:02:24.402
check out. It also adds vehicle selection for referral rewards. Dedicated iPad layouts now include

00:02:24.402 --> 00:02:30.442
vehicle controls, climate, tire pressure, and navigation sized for larger screens. The changes

00:02:30.442 --> 00:02:35.442
introduce market-aware wording that switches between self-driving and assisted driving depending on

00:02:35.442 --> 00:02:42.777
region, with a European Union or EU fallback option. Customer sales of the CyberCab are intended to

00:02:42.777 --> 00:02:49.177
begin before the end of 2026. Tesla stated, according to Arena EV, the vehicle remains

00:02:49.177 --> 00:02:54.057
in early production testing. The announcement comes alongside continued expansion of the

00:02:54.057 --> 00:03:00.450
unsupervised FSD software that will power the Robotaxi fleet. Ford will fit a standard

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:07.090
extended range battery across trims on the 2027 Mustang Mach-E. Drive Tesla Canada reports.

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:12.970
A new trail package adds off-road-oriented features to the electric crossover. The changes

00:03:12.970 --> 00:03:18.430
position the vehicle more directly against Tesla's Model Y in the compact electric SUV segment.

00:03:19.391 --> 00:03:24.711
Energy pledged $20 million to finance additional Tesla's supercharger sites through its charged

00:03:24.711 --> 00:03:30.911
EV platform, according to the EV report. The commitment expands the firm's US portfolio of

00:03:30.911 --> 00:03:35.891
charging infrastructure. The funds target new site development and equipment deployment across

00:03:35.891 --> 00:03:41.782
multiple states. The Tesla Model Y leads the United Kingdom's electric vehicle, or EV,

00:03:41.782 --> 00:03:45.202
high-mileage rankings compiled by select car leasing.

00:03:45.662 --> 00:03:49.162
The data tracks real-world usage across registered EVs.

00:03:49.642 --> 00:03:54.102
The ranking places the model Y ahead of other battery electric models in average annual

00:03:54.102 --> 00:03:54.902
distance driven.

00:03:55.949 --> 00:04:02.249
GM outlined plans to expand its on-star app and in-car artificial intelligence or AI features

00:04:02.249 --> 00:04:07.169
to compete directly with Tesla and Rivian software ecosystems, motor trend reports.

00:04:07.169 --> 00:04:12.369
The strategy targets both phone-based services and vehicle-integrated autonomy tools.

00:04:12.689 --> 00:04:17.269
The moves aim to close the gap in over-the-air updates and app-based ownership experience.

00:04:17.709 --> 00:04:22.941
The Model 3 lost certain features and $17,000 of its price in one market.

00:04:23.461 --> 00:04:28.421
The Straits Times reports, Tesla made the cuts to better compete with Chinese EV offerings.

00:04:28.881 --> 00:04:32.161
The adjusted model targets price-sensitive buyers in that region.

00:04:32.161 --> 00:04:37.321
The changes reflect on-going pressure from lower-cost domestic competitors in key export

00:04:37.321 --> 00:04:37.881
markets.

00:04:38.928 --> 00:04:44.488
Tesla will refund all Australian cyber truck deposits collected since 2019 and close

00:04:44.488 --> 00:04:47.308
the reservation list, auto-evolution reports.

00:04:47.868 --> 00:04:52.448
The company cited the absence of right-hand drive development and low U.S. production volumes

00:04:52.448 --> 00:04:55.568
as reasons for dropping plans for Australia and New Zealand.

00:04:56.428 --> 00:05:01.908
Effected reservation holders receive a one-year FSD supervised subscription offer if they purchase

00:05:01.908 --> 00:05:08.548
a Model 3 or Model Y. Deposits of 150 Australian dollars were taken starting in 2019.

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:15.270
Rivian acquired Third Dimension AI, a United Kingdom firm, Drive Tesla Canada reports.

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:21.310
A former Tesla autopilot simulation lead now heads the acquired team. The purchase targets

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:26.530
faster development of Rivian's self-driving software. The startup specializes in simulation

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:29.390
that reduce the need for real-world test miles.

00:05:30.427 --> 00:05:33.247
Chicago had a cyber cab on public roads this morning.

00:05:33.887 --> 00:05:35.707
Rob Maurer shared a photo of the vehicle.

00:05:36.307 --> 00:05:41.187
FSD version 14.3.13 ran a 300-mile test drive

00:05:41.187 --> 00:05:43.227
with flawless toll-plasma navigation.

00:05:43.767 --> 00:05:44.767
Tesla Roddy reported.

00:05:45.407 --> 00:05:49.127
The route included highway, turnpike, local roads and back roads.

00:05:50.147 --> 00:05:52.467
A Tesla SpaceX merger cannot be blocked

00:05:52.467 --> 00:05:54.107
without proof of competitive harm.

00:05:54.107 --> 00:06:00.267
T-S-L-A-M noted, regulators must also demonstrate an incentive to exclude competitors.

00:06:00.787 --> 00:06:04.947
Mid-term election results would leave antitrust review with the Federal Trade Commission,

00:06:05.227 --> 00:06:08.687
or FTC, or the Department of Justice, or DOJ.

00:06:09.287 --> 00:06:10.967
The review would not move to Congress.

00:06:12.212 --> 00:06:16.372
Homeowners in California reported water leaks near their Tesla solar roof installations

00:06:16.372 --> 00:06:19.712
that required expensive repairs, the cooldown reports.

00:06:19.712 --> 00:06:24.152
reports. The incidents raise questions about long-term ceiling performance of integrated

00:06:24.152 --> 00:06:29.692
solar roofing systems in real-world weather exposure. Tesla has not issued a public response

00:06:29.692 --> 00:06:36.982
to the specific cases. Nearly $6.5 billion in cumulative taxes over 38 years is the county's

00:06:36.982 --> 00:06:41.962
projection if the plant reaches full production. That number assumes full output by the early

00:06:41.962 --> 00:06:47.962
2030s, and a factory that stays competitive against both domestic and imported solar modules.

00:06:47.962 --> 00:06:53.182
Tax incentives for a project this size rest on a local government forecasting decades of

00:06:53.182 --> 00:06:54.742
revenue from a single facility.

00:06:55.302 --> 00:06:59.682
The site sits inside Port FreePort's foreign trade zone number 149.

00:07:00.222 --> 00:07:05.382
That zone removes local property tax on eligible inventory in exchange for zero dollar pilot

00:07:05.382 --> 00:07:07.162
payments during the abatement period.

00:07:07.742 --> 00:07:11.402
The structure shifts when the county gets paid rather than wiping the bill out.

00:07:12.002 --> 00:07:16.882
If Tesla builds elsewhere, the county receives nothing beyond the administrative cost of drafting

00:07:16.882 --> 00:07:21.882
the agreements. The county accepts deferred revenue for the chance at a vertically integrated

00:07:21.882 --> 00:07:27.722
solar supply chain next to the existing Megapack plant in Brookshire. The outcome hinges on whether

00:07:27.722 --> 00:07:33.602
Tesla's own demand for cells and modules justifies the capital outlay. It also hinges on whether

00:07:33.602 --> 00:07:39.202
the chosen site delivers the projected logistics savings. Counties that misjudge either variable

00:07:39.202 --> 00:07:45.062
hold agreements that never convert into taxable activity. The headline figure only materializes if

00:07:45.062 --> 00:07:49.002
the facility reaches commercial scale and stays there for the full term of the deal.

00:07:49.842 --> 00:07:54.642
Before we go, the next concrete update on the solar factory is which site Tesla actually

00:07:54.642 --> 00:07:54.922
picks.

